{s:OUT,k:'outro',term:'Outro',say:`So remember: a snubber moves loss, it does not save it. Count both edges. And a wider gap means a thinner, faster switch. Next time, diode rectifiers: half-wave, full-wave and bridge. See you there!`,cues:{f:'So remember',w1:'a snubber moves',w2:'Count both edges',w3:'And a wider',n:'Next time',s:'See you there'},words:[['SNUBBERS MOVE LOSS','BLU','w1'],['COUNT BOTH EDGES','ORG','w2'],['WIDE GAP: THIN AND FAST','GRN','w3']],next:["NEXT TIME", "Next lesson", "Diode rectifiers: half-wave, full-wave and bridge", "book"],end:'See you there!'}
